A||||14||Mickey_Moose||UP3 Radio and Theftlock||||5||
Z||000000||Mickey_Moose||12-18-2001||06:32 PM||||Ok, I got an UP3 radio with the Theftlock not coded...question is, what is the procedure to set up a code AND once battery has been removed, how does one put the code back in? (operational instructions)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>thanks<BR>Tim<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Devotshka||12-18-2001||06:46 PM||||These are general directions for most TheftLock radios, they should work---<P>1.Turn ignition in run or accessory position<BR>2.Turn radio off<BR>3.You have 15 seconds between steps else you must start the procedure over again.<BR>4.Press the 1 and 4 buttons together until --- appears in the display.<BR>5.Press the MIN button and 000 will appear in the display.<BR>6.Press the MIN button to make the last two digits agree with your code.<BR>7.Press the HR button to make the first one or two digits agree with your code.<BR>8.Once you have confirmed the code matches, press AM/FM.  The display will show "rEP" to indicate you need to repeat above steps to confirm your code.<BR>9.Press AM/FM again and the display will read SEC, indicating your radio is secure.<P><BR>When the battery ahs been removed and a code is in place, the display will read LOC.<BR>to unlock:<BR>1.LOC will appear when ignition is on<BR>2.Press MIN and 000 will appear on the display<BR>3.Press MIN again and make the last two digits appear on the display.<BR>4.Press HR and make the first one or two digits appear on the display.<BR>5.After confirming your code, press AM/FM .  SEC will appear on the display indicating that the radio is now operable and secure.<P>If you fail after 8 attempts at re-entering the code, InOP will appear on the display.  Your radio is now inoperative.  At this point you will need to keep the ignition on for one hour before you may attempt to enter another code.  You will have 3 more attempts.<P>Removing THEFTLOCK is the same as setting the code.<P>Hope that helps!||||reg||1
Z||000002||jelly2m8||12-18-2001||09:38 PM||||Great post Devotshka!<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/pegged%2001.jpg"> ||||reg||1
